# Required: Google AI Studio API key. Get one free at
# https://aistudio.google.com/apikey — no credit card required.
# Read by api/design-garden.ts via process.env in both dev (loaded by
# vite.config.ts) and prod (injected by Vercel).
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# Optional but recommended: Upstash Redis (free tier). Sign up at
# https://upstash.com, create a Redis database, then grab the "REST"
# credentials (NOT the TCP ones — Edge functions can only talk HTTP).
# Free tier: 10K commands/day, 256MB storage — plenty for portfolio
# traffic.
#
# Used by api/garden.ts to store short-URL → garden mappings, producing
# clean URLs like blossom.aidenjang.com/g/abc123. If these are missing,
# the app falls back to encoding the full garden directly in the URL,
# which produces longer (~450-char) but still functional share links.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://...upstash.io
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=...
